    "notes": "Federal facts only. [2026-11-08 research] BIA site oglalalakotanation.org returns 404; SDNTA's oglalalakotanation.info is NOT official (third-party, casino ad) - never use. oglala.gov per SD Tribal Relations. OSPRA online licenses https://ospra.nagfa.net/online/. Tatanka Lodge (OSPRA) is in the Wounded Knee community - left out for human decision: https://www.oglalasiouxparksandrec.net/tatanka-lodge/. Prairie Wind ownership confirmed by news, not casino site. DNA placeholder page empty (https://destinationnativeamerica.com/tribes/oglala-sioux-tribe), not linked."
